<title>USA: Cook Inlet group cuts LIN Television stake.</title>
<headline>Cook Inlet group cuts LIN Television stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Cook Inlet Region Inc said Tuesday it reduced its stake in LIN Television Corp to 6.3 percent or 1,880,450 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold 1,080,000 shares of LIN between September 12 and 30 at prices ranging from $35.l625 to $41.75 a share.</p>
